# Build, CI and deployment files are attack surface: owner review required.
# Solo developer: "Require review from Code Owners" is intentionally NOT enabled (assumption A-015).
# This file still documents ownership and starts enforcing the day a second contributor joins.
/.github/                      @RedeArmy
/deploy/                       @RedeArmy
/scripts/                      @RedeArmy
/Makefile                      @RedeArmy
/Directory.*.props             @RedeArmy
/global.json                   @RedeArmy
/.pre-commit-config.yaml       @RedeArmy
/.editorconfig                 @RedeArmy
/docs/adr/                     @RedeArmy
/docs/threat-model/            @RedeArmy
/src/Modules/*/Infrastructure/Migrations/ @RedeArmy
